Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:09.67,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}I was sucked into your dimension
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:12.34,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}ショゲ腐っていらんない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:14.47,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}ベタなシチュエーション
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:16.84,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}Hand in glove we fight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.86,0:00:19.06,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}Chemistry is right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:21.72,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}傾げた顔を上げて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:27.15,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}The viper in the shadows striking them all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:30.77,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}点を逸らす暇もない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.87,0:00:32.47,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}But you can't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:34.16,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}Stop the feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:36.41,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}Take a beating
